WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.272
Your birthday is a playing card.

2
00:00:02.272 --> 00:00:03.421
Do you know which one?

3
00:00:04.121 --> 00:00:05.871
In the Cardology tradition,

4
00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.491
your month and day map to

5
00:00:07.491 --> 00:00:09.241
one card in a 52 card deck.

6
00:00:09.841 --> 00:00:11.812
Enter your birthday in the free calculator.

7
00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:13.004
You'll get your birth card

8
00:00:13.004 --> 00:00:14.334
and a first reflection, free.

9
00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.070
Every card has a side at its best,

10
00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.703
and a side pushed too far.

11
00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:21.530
It's a prompt for reflection, not a forecast.

12
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.849
You decide what fits.

13
00:00:23.549 --> 00:00:25.683
Curious how you connect with someone else?

14
00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:26.902
My Chemistry Check reads

15
00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:28.325
two people's cards together.

16
00:00:28.325 --> 00:00:30.916
I prepare it privately and send it to you by email.

17
00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:34.912
Find your birth card free at cardblueprints.com.
